use ../../../lib/UiComponent

from ../Button import Button

export ui-component ToggleButton:
    description:
        A toggle button stays pressed in or popped out, like a Bold button in a
        text editor. Pressing it switches between the two and takes effect
        straight away, and it looks different in each state.

    composes:
        - @{Button}

    pressed:
        It is either pressed or not, with nothing in between. Pressing it
        switches the state straight away and tells the component using it. That
        component can also set the state at any time. If the button is disabled
        or busy, pressing it does nothing and the state doesn't change.

    name:
        The name says what is being turned on or off, and stays the same in
        both states. Whether it is pressed is conveyed separately.

    nonGoals:
        - The name doesn't change with the state. A button whose text changes to
            say what it will do next, like Play then Pause, is an ordinary
            Button whose label is changed by the component using it
